# Player-facing modpack files are hashed byte-for-byte by packwiz (SHA256 of the exact bytes
# raw.githubusercontent.com serves). Git's CRLF normalization on checkout/commit silently
# changes those bytes on Windows, which makes a locally-computed hash disagree with the real
# committed blob and breaks every download with "Hash invalid!". Disable all text conversion
# repo-wide so a Windows checkout is always byte-identical to what's committed.
* -text
